{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1000_014mir", "source_sha256": "8545351e938dd921661d2a10aeef766e8cbdaa434980f4fbbd1a98a5dde65be8", "ja": "静香ちゃん、翼！　今度のライブ、楽しみだね～。\n新しい曲、歌うんだよね。どんな感じになるのかな？", "zh": "小静、翼！我好期待下次的演唱会喔～\n要唱新歌对吧，不知道是什么样的歌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "19de5ebbd2f9bc82c1ce7c2a3d41a74b509ff4c9a158d2d24226fd1161e1a4d6", "ja": "その話もいいけど、未来。さっきから手が止まってる。\n入り口に飾るものなんだから、ちゃんと作らなくちゃ。", "zh": "未来，你要聊天是没关系，但你从刚刚手都没在动。\n这个是要装饰在入口处的，得仔细做好才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "6b271e3b09bae458f6d1137c157f42fdb4bfa90d1605564ee498c01aa8284d31", "ja": "えへへ、そうでした～。\nお花、何個作ればいいんだっけ？", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿，说得也是～\n是说要做几朵花才够？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d629b05c9cff655cd0807509fd5a7dc2d9823a162587ae7fa7f595437fbeffbb", "ja": "会場の飾り付けまでわたし達の手作りなんて……\nもしかして、765プロって、ビンボーなのかな～？", "zh": "竟然连会场装饰都要我们亲自动手做……\n该不会765艺能其实很穷吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "2d3d92181816a313b1ea91af1fe72fd3f91a4d4020c30c7004b161160060f040", "ja": "ちょっ……翼、そういうことを言わないの！\nそりゃ、私も少し心配だと思ったけど……。", "zh": "等等……翼，不要说那种话啦！\n虽然我多少也有点担心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7beb22883971beb2153526a95bbcc5b08388b3135ff82ca6cfcdf3dae50a70bb", "ja": "いや、そこまで貧乏っていうわけじゃ……\n今回は、みんなの手作り感を出したかったんだよ。", "zh": "不用担心，我们还没有穷到那个地步……\n只是这次希望呈现出大家亲手制作的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9ea188d7bcfff6118bb74a6982ca43bd52adc2c1b98a75610cb006b60a93741b", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さんだ♪\nおはようございまーす♪", "zh": "啊，是{$P$}先生♪\n早安──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "99738abdb75742333660bfe7541e6c845cc1b4ca109f0e6b475b4fad5b1934f8", "ja": "お疲れさまです。", "zh": "辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "21cf153708019de977a3835bd06d779b2ccf3133dfa342f3d57b64fd2b4827c8", "ja": "『手作り感』ですかぁ、なるほど！\nじゃあ、たくさん作らないとですね！", "zh": "『亲手制作的感觉』啊，原来如此！\n那得多做点才行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2a027c70f43e68ff0161ddd89d56875c987184dd7b0a6e09d691e63ef7257201", "ja": "ああ、よろしく頼む。\n……あれ？　翼は何してるんだ？", "zh": "是啊，拜托你们了。\n……咦？翼你在做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "60e89a7e110e71c2d7e64c267552cd8ddf8c8764221e3841eb3ba615f17a3108", "ja": "わたしは、アンケートに答えてました♪\nあっ、そうそう！　それで思い出しちゃった。", "zh": "我在写问卷♪\n啊，对了！这让我想到一件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "33c6f37b8046ea1d28626fd5bc60b4b4c54a97702970c98ce4c341977ef8bd16", "ja": "ねーねー、未来、静香ちゃん！\nふたりとも、好きな人っているの？", "zh": "欸欸～未来、小静！\n你们有喜欢的人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "89368eb580e3b01e49dc35e7c6cda29c62aa3570c5782244da7c6119ebf9902b", "ja": "好きな人？", "zh": "喜欢的人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "0631edd289bee38e61d9bb4ee4e3a255c28c4918a0be23978cbbd996dc7aa2b0", "ja": "えっ……えええっ！！？\nす、好きな人！？　翼、あなた突然何を……！", "zh": "咦……咦咦咦！！？\n喜、喜欢的人！？翼，你怎么突然问这个……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4c3af8ed2501977ce314144e79d66667387ac348500a819b4490b68de8e2acb4", "ja": "本当に突然だな……。\n翼、急にどうしたんだ？", "zh": "真的很突然呢……\n翼，为什么忽然这么问？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "ea982b0f968709948523f4eb90728295c219ec7a44861039b39ebf137c390dd2", "ja": "あっ、わかった！\n私の好きな人は、お父さんとお母さんです♪", "zh": "啊，我想到了！\n我喜欢的人是爸爸和妈妈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5be4386f336a395c20e9eec10c9eba55a6f2777efb5b5137b878b6a691caf776", "ja": "もー、未来は～。そういう好きじゃなくて、\nもっとちゃんと好きな人ってことなの！", "zh": "未来真是的～我说的不是那种喜欢，\n是在讲真正喜欢的人喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "b50e4b735a0f3050014adce0892e45330b5bbd70d19ff65586586bc7772326cd", "ja": "未来、ちょっと黙ってて……。えっと、翼？\nそもそも、どうしてそんな事を聞くのよ？", "zh": "未来，你先不要说话……那个，翼？\n为什么你会想问这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "215b87e843611daea790d62c246a59a95010c9fe8788ff872adc5e08fe94d26a", "ja": "え？　だってふたりとも、聞いてないの？\n『新人アイドルに超接近☆スペシャルアンケート』！", "zh": "咦？你们两个没被问到吗？\n『新人偶像的贴身调查☆特别问卷』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c8ac3612cc5aca2a88724a9fc5819599a53876a4ee3cf7b77796bd50e45e64eb", "ja": "ですよね？　{$P$}さん。", "zh": "我没说错吧，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1020_p", "source_sha256": "7b1ca5f21774212fb5a93739bbca3f812e684bdbd6d65f39192179c51d214215", "ja": "……ああ、前に頼んだアイドル雑誌の企画の話か。\nふたりにも頼んだけど、まだ見てなかったんだな。", "zh": "……啊，原来是我之前拜托你参加的偶像杂志企划啊。\n我也有拜托你们两个，但你们应该还没看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "242a3dd769027fde6d084fb32fc6cc7ed9388f7c424c4e00f367f1c3dc3b1ace", "ja": "それじゃ、アイドル雑誌に、\n私達の答えが載っちゃうんですか？", "zh": "所以偶像杂志上，\n会刊登我们的回答啰？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "7571c2a28abd9c2bfab12e27b6c992e9f1c543f3a2bd844f82fc567211c6baa1", "ja": "えっ、やだ！？　こんな質問があるなんて、\nそんなの聞いてな……ど、どうしよう！", "zh": "咦，讨厌！？竟然有这种问题，\n我都不知道……怎、怎么办！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1024_p", "source_sha256": "747d3940038b3a587e3bd103d07206705ed828051e498bb11b73f1527118d2ee", "ja": "そうだな。みんなの年頃なら、\n素直な気持ちを書いてもいいと思うけど……。", "zh": "我想想，以大家的年纪，\n我觉得照自己心里想的回答就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1025_p", "source_sha256": "c7fe061d9c3baeada188eda7610b12790db364a14f26e974c3a3bc9d30b331b4", "ja": "でも、仮にもアイドルだし。\nそういうことは、秘密でもいいと思うよ。", "zh": "不过，你们毕竟是偶像。\n这种事情就算保密也没关系喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "49aaae21c5566c8580dab82182f3d734ccfbd479bc1e482b2224f7286f1bf9eb", "ja": "そ、そう！　そうですよね……。\nはぁ、よかった……。", "zh": "没、没错！这么说也对……\n呼，太好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1027_016tsu", "source_sha256": "89ad2840cb638f772316d305e11265921f22c5e7106e81e033c247ee2fbff780", "ja": "えーっ？　つまんなーい。\nみんなの好きな人の話、聞きたかったのにー。", "zh": "咦～？真无趣。\n我本来还想知道大家喜欢的人是谁呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1028_p", "source_sha256": "6ea4447e109550ee0404f0f6da00886705df4f6c96f9760dd5e6b6c9e8674373", "ja": "だったら、そうだな。\nたとえば……。", "zh": "这样的话，对了。\n比方说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1029_p", "source_sha256": "696005255ac39c0a59d72edf9f569ab361b07ce717e86f2280179ac566521083", "ja": "今度の全体公演での晴れ姿を、一番見てほしい人、\nとかでもいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "「这次全体公演盛装出席时，最想让谁看到？」\n像这种答案应该也可以吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "2282726f9393197b3d2ebb274f62ffe26b75f5da4f5dbba0232a40a0e5abcfe3", "ja": "一番……。", "zh": "最想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "e710d728424fb2eaaf6c23e4a18355596da4c99e09f494d3468a9ec2fd88c03f", "ja": "見てほしい人……。", "zh": "让谁看到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1032_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fd9f96bfb40db874e73e9344594691074b8f0c9052f3aa99d73d139cfcfdcf4e", "ja": "わたしは、{$P$}さんに\n見てほしいかも～♪", "zh": "我想让{$P$}先生看～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1033_014mir", "source_sha256": "9cbf23a5d7f71ab50e921cd168c98631772d9e5a98b55afa48043c0ba0092ac8", "ja": "あっ、翼ってば、ズルーイ！", "zh": "啊，翼你好贼～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1034_015siz", "source_sha256": "7d9971e63131a5a4ed9d890fc27c6f83f08cfdc08873834079a71a4d42a9d669", "ja": "ず、ズルくないでしょ。\nお父さんとお母さんはいいの、未来？", "zh": "这、这样不算贼吧。\n未来，你回答爸爸和妈妈就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1035_014mir", "source_sha256": "df0f03523ed834125ccc1d1b4821a04aafac6b06a6a4e85bb50749311707268d", "ja": "あっ、よくないかも！", "zh": "啊，好像不太好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1036_p", "source_sha256": "162b2c58a901a1feb6a636c1c2b23e6cbd41616c2117b628739c602482274f8a", "ja": "そういう静香は、誰に見て欲しいんだ？", "zh": "那么静香想让谁看呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1037_015siz", "source_sha256": "93744237be754c48ffb933aa55b39283c73dc84a3cc2d75e3b49367e5a230e25", "ja": "そ、それは……だ、誰でもいいじゃないですか。\nそんなことを聞くなんて、デリカシーがありませんっ。", "zh": "那、那种事……谁、谁看都无所谓吧。\n你竟然问这种问题，神经真大条！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1038_p", "source_sha256": "137dc8063dbee26f496b1244997a2eba8b906b4c7fdee72f007aef1941431ecf", "ja": "はは、ごめんごめん。\nまあ、ゆっくり考えてくれ！", "zh": "哈哈，抱歉、抱歉。\n总之，你们就慢慢想吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
