{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1040_025roc", "source_sha256": "33ba3151df30033e60acda2cfc52e67cca9415c4ac620edc478f7b3f2e7a7362", "ja": "ユリコさん、ネバーギブアップです……。\nここで諦めたら、ロコ達は……うう……。", "zh": "百合子，Never give up……\n要是现在就放弃，ROCO我们就……唔唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
