{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1042_p", "source_sha256": "9ad203ba56276d69b6df9c9577c772b7088d9f8dee564c0edf2cf544cb34f244", "ja": "百合子、ロコ、お疲れさま。\n飲み物を持ってきたから、少し休憩したらどうだ？", "zh": "百合子、ROCO，辛苦你们了。\n我带了饮料来，稍微休息一下吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1043_026yur", "source_sha256": "f254ce415e747610ab29fe00d0fde7cb4274967643cf5d74f9c70925f6da32e3", "ja": "あっ……{$P$}（さん）！", "zh": "啊……{$P$}（先生）！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
