{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1045_p", "source_sha256": "054911a7258a7abeac539fb0c317a129e60058a8fac4f2405a21737923db7aa2", "ja": "ふたりとも、自主練ずいぶん頑張ってるんだな。\nけど……何かあったのか？", "zh": "你们两个都很努力地自主练习呢。\n不过……是有什么原因吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1046_025roc", "source_sha256": "14764d7d1fc90fc95c4f9294e07a10706246e7e6f85610c17aac7e544e5117a3", "ja": "それはですね……ええと……。", "zh": "这个嘛……就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1047_026yur", "source_sha256": "ac028e7d3cc0cfbae7270ad2c37d57bb7c9288313c33f2f9c84c0b06ed3b3a5e", "ja": "えっと……{$P$}さんも\nご存知のとおり、私達、運動がちょっぴり苦手で……。", "zh": "那个……就如{$P$}先生所知，\n我们不太擅长运动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1048_026yur", "source_sha256": "2105d7fc542f3d1ce9a61021ea7a0fb2343ecc49e4c6a66306c539d9f7c3f2ac", "ja": "だから、今回は一緒に頑張って……次のライブ、\nなんとか乗り越えられたらって話し合ったんです。", "zh": "所以我们一起努力练习……\n说好一定要想办法顺利完成下次的演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1049_025roc", "source_sha256": "9c43cba720f2491f79f7574e6a715253210f550e2ff73c3d07f8a4091a398d46", "ja": "ダンスレッスン、ロコひとりでは超えられない\n壁でしたけど……ユリコさんとなら、頑張れそうです。", "zh": "Dance lesson是ROCO一个人无法突破的难题……\n但如果和百合子一起练习，就能比较有动力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1050_026yur", "source_sha256": "cd33b8040b99934056c92cfae18ea53d5721f75fe33c5530a9e1a13b90db07e7", "ja": "そんな、ロコさん……私のほうこそ、\nひとりじゃ絶対、諦めてたって思います。", "zh": "你太客气了，ROCO……\n我才是，如果只有我一个人，绝对早就放弃了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1051_p", "source_sha256": "52c8c851bfa0da3e06a2bd1aba08795d5d315726b19f6d32cb85b637e5d870a3", "ja": "そうか。お互いに励まし合って、弱点を\n乗り越えようとしてるのか。えらいな、ふたりとも。", "zh": "这样啊。你们互相勉励，努力一起克服弱点吗？\n你们两个真了不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1052_026yur", "source_sha256": "ef5855fb57d9c460c3cb43c2a41f1b9a9f91d96dadd424d79939354cb770b799", "ja": "えへへ……♪", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1053_025roc", "source_sha256": "ef5855fb57d9c460c3cb43c2a41f1b9a9f91d96dadd424d79939354cb770b799", "ja": "えへへ……♪", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1054_p", "source_sha256": "7fba495e3b182017018ab66c7bc738c4ee2290a1fedf5c1de39c5508a8b2123d", "ja": "それはいいんだけど……ふたりは同じ年なのに、\nどうして敬語で話してるんだ？", "zh": "这是件好事没错……不过你们明明年纪一样大，\n为什么对彼此讲话那么客气？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1055_026yur", "source_sha256": "9b9d277b3f8d3999a302ab8e3bb81e30900e385c02bae5a099653216be2736e1", "ja": "えっ？\nあっ……そ、そうなんですか！？", "zh": "咦？\n啊……是、是这样吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1056_025roc", "source_sha256": "4f179e3b011dbf0dccad093953efd553beb79c47a4b0d6223056ab9fc358aff2", "ja": "ロコはてっきり、ユリコさんの方が\n年上だと思ってました……。", "zh": "ROCO还以为百合子年纪比较大……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1057_026yur", "source_sha256": "33b50efb8249ff705326591b40f51181477fab6033970970a957c01746489f52", "ja": "私も……。", "zh": "我也是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1058_p", "source_sha256": "696df96e0367089273c7cba547372ab1ce4e3ad7fd24ac8bb0e5d77a0fbe9e7d", "ja": "なんだ、お互いに年上だと思って遠慮してただけか。\nあとは……昴と朋花も、同じ15歳だな。", "zh": "原来你们只是以为对方年纪比较大，才那么客气啊。\n除了你们……昴和朋花，也都是15岁喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1059_026yur", "source_sha256": "2f1cd9f89cd74ff1c1a067d77680f0a08a14bcd64bf0e399a60ee815c575bfcc", "ja": "昴さんかぁ……。", "zh": "昴啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1060_026yur", "source_sha256": "873dbdffe059057b98f32f1778511e543698d5038c6c806d674d4b6b20c55498", "ja": "私、まだあんまりお話したことないんですよね。\nどんな人なんだろう……。", "zh": "我还没什么机会和她说到话。\n她是怎么样的人呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1061_025roc", "source_sha256": "07747957f91fad4572de1ee3227d217daed7203abcb5034dce5f2f5a7122bd73", "ja": "スバルはロコ達と違って、運動神経がバツグンです。\nちょっと、強引ですけど……。", "zh": "昴和ROCO我们不一样，运动细胞超强。\n虽然个性有点强势……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1062_026yur", "source_sha256": "18222f0646bf84d89138e46037569d23073423df384694ffd151f9212d656a78", "ja": "そ、そうなんだ。運動神経バツグンで、強引……\nそんな人と、お友達になれるのかな……。", "zh": "这、这样啊，运动细胞超强、个性强势……\n我有办法和那样的人成为朋友吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1063_026yur", "source_sha256": "a78d2ae55f6f99a44fe19eeec97ac4826faf1b6f9012acf74e002029723bbb91", "ja": "ううん、もしかしたら、それ以前に……。\n鈍くさいヤツだって、呆れられちゃうかも！？", "zh": "不对，搞不好在成为朋友之前……\n她就会因为我太迟钝而受不了我！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1064_p", "source_sha256": "6149ec6fa5d048c0e649e1b3091ea862bd0ac913788e9b1c7243d4308841e55d", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、百合子。\n心配しなくても、昴は優しい子だから。", "zh": "放心吧，百合子。\n你不用担心，昴她人很好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1065_025roc", "source_sha256": "3d8807aa62a29901d6768eabe9ba2379307586c0e2dacd94b51cdbc8496011af", "ja": "そうですよ、ユリコさ……ユリコ！\nスバルはそんな子じゃないって、ロコは思います。", "zh": "就是说啊，百合……百合子！\nROCO觉得昴不是那样的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1066_026yur", "source_sha256": "ff5706862338fd5f1b0bd41f5f16a6dcd960590cd25586e710b679d5d83db115", "ja": "ロコちゃん……うん、そうだよね！\n仲良くなれるといいなぁ……。", "zh": "ROCO……嗯，我想也是！\n希望能跟她好好相处……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1067_025roc", "source_sha256": "9dc6b088951c307b5e62eb312ddec6a27965ee1b43816fc48d496b56e87486d1", "ja": "ロコは、トモカとも仲良くなりたいです！\nトモカには、独特の雰囲気があります……。", "zh": "ROCO想要和朋花变成朋友！\n朋花有种独特的气质……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1068_026yur", "source_sha256": "c1a40cf4be7f5453de651c914a7c1420f346e8a5fa6e00028f891cc39bf67635", "ja": "あっ、それ、わかります！\nなんか、オーラがすごいっていうか……。", "zh": "啊，我懂你说的！\n仿佛有很强大的气场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1069_025roc", "source_sha256": "6ca9e9c4ca941566e148528fbde3237bf54d182a37c85b8e3e6bbb937083129e", "ja": "ユリコ、知ってますか？\nトモカはファンから、聖母と呼ばれているそうですよ！", "zh": "百合子你知道吗？\n听说朋花的粉丝们，都叫她圣母喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1070_026yur", "source_sha256": "f200fea4214c15fafa807ec5e960e4269ade96577d8a268bbd0e1f3da1f04cc9", "ja": "そうなの！？　でも、なんだかそれもわかる……。\nファンを導く聖母かぁ、素敵な響きだね……♪", "zh": "是吗！？不过，我好像也可以理解……\n引领粉丝们的圣母吗，听起来好棒喔……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1071_p", "source_sha256": "64d98caf23185cac497b9f121d8cf6b386c261775660879d523465522fe353a7", "ja": "（……同い年だと、感じ方も似てくるのかもな）", "zh": "（……或许年龄相仿，对事物的看法也会比较相近呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1072_025roc", "source_sha256": "f2d25ed6bac9867c4a5d646bcec44c969cfcebefafc5f2d878931ad27774d065", "ja": "ロコはトモカと仲良くなれたら、\nトモカをモデルに、アートを作ってみたいです♪", "zh": "等ROCO和朋花成为朋友后，\nROCO要把朋花当成创作Art的模特儿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1073_026yur", "source_sha256": "f54b36156c029cb41b5f2039bcf0a7af2d3e53903f541f7a4ad0fe0ffac58e58", "ja": "わぁ……それ、素敵ですね！\n朋花さん、きっと喜びますよ！", "zh": "哇……听起来很不错！\n朋花肯定也会很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1074_025roc", "source_sha256": "5e6b0c4b563c7c1f976c808c841712b494264da1a040833b18117a18cc1f7be0", "ja": "えへへ……そ、そうでしょうか……。\nえへへへへ……。", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿……是、是这样吗……？\n嘿嘿嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1075_026yur", "source_sha256": "6cf1a37d413d04eb9de2bfa09a3e663298aaa3a4956cc9479df75c33c5293a1a", "ja": "ふふっ、楽しいなぁ……アイドルになって、こんなに\n楽しく過ごせるなんて、思ってもみませんでした。", "zh": "呵呵，真开心……我以前都没想过，\n原来成为偶像，可以过得这么开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1076_026yur", "source_sha256": "570f01262003368d1ae22e3336f719730e13f27e5d241bfb5a0663f385287268", "ja": "実は、今だから話しちゃいますけど……\n私、本当はすごく人見知りなんです。", "zh": "老实说，到现在我才敢说出口……\n我其实很怕生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1077_025roc", "source_sha256": "420505f1d02ef16dae32f5c34abe8b07db51b2367f93bc4c908fe9756d3d51fe", "ja": "っ……。", "zh": "……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1078_p", "source_sha256": "a7d64d47253264c40bfb1a786365bb18873fa62820e5638636c2a339146cab65", "ja": "へぇ、そうだったのか？", "zh": "咦，是真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1079_026yur", "source_sha256": "59791734bb427296dada9667d6a85016bf33279ccddeef8e466dd808cac80f6f", "ja": "はい！　でもこうして{$P$}さんや\nロコちゃんと話せて、なんだかホッとしました！", "zh": "是的！但像这样和{$P$}先生，\n还有ROCO说过后，总觉得松了口气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1080_026yur", "source_sha256": "a4e224c434fdab0530946f1a6c84f7181b7039107b304e58a36a2855ea796014", "ja": "昴さんも、朋花さんも……ううん。\n他のみんなとだって、きっと仲良くなれますよね？", "zh": "昴和朋花……不对，\n还有其他人，我应该也能和她们成为朋友吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1081_p", "source_sha256": "23b9e929fc35607c3b223f35eb8f63d2a0d69f46872048f83a9f40b83e7fe95e", "ja": "もちろん。百合子が仲良くしたいって\n思ってるなら、絶対に仲良くなれるさ。", "zh": "当然。只要百合子有意愿和大家做朋友，\n大家肯定能相处愉快。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1082_026yur", "source_sha256": "afcd07b8579f541d5d0217c79cab406790d24cee152be28072354fdf03a5232f", "ja": "{$P$}さん……ふふっ。\nそれだけでも、アイドルになってよかったです！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……呵呵。\n光是这样，我就很庆幸能成为偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1083_025roc", "source_sha256": "2f4fd9adae4fe485e1edc15e03c2c2f6c89577dc96e3bd779f7ba25d28008c47", "ja": "……ユリコは、アンナとよく話してるから、\n人見知りなんてしないのかと思ってました。", "zh": "……百合子经常会和杏奈聊天，\nROCO还以为你不怕生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1084_026yur", "source_sha256": "c60226d2fcf75d543a80367809a7f853831c474f6b3f693df5ff8793b0fed5cf", "ja": "それは、好きなもののことだけなの……。\n杏奈ちゃんとは、ゲームって共通点もあるから。", "zh": "那只限于在讲喜欢的事物时……\n我和小杏都很喜欢电玩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1085_p", "source_sha256": "4e5c450cb892bae0e85e65891a8a79c88feac5098d77c47ca3b00ec06e74acec", "ja": "そうか……だからふたりは、気が合ったのかな？", "zh": "这样啊……所以你们才会那么合得来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1086_p", "source_sha256": "d9d54bd61dba52d5dafab28c23ea2de7140fe651e28e347412044bfd396bfaa1", "ja": "百合子もロコも、それぞれ好きなものがあって、\nそれについて熱くなってしまう辺りは、似てるんだな。", "zh": "百合子和ROCO都有自己喜欢的事物，\n一提到就会不自觉地兴奋起来这点，感觉很像呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1087_026yur", "source_sha256": "ce5e27b748306de09ca27e0b328a8951d0ba5a62a7642e7c54c736e36b4377cb", "ja": "あっ……そ、そうかもしれないです……。\nそっか……私達、似てたんだね……。", "zh": "啊……说、说不定喔……\n这样啊……我们很像呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1088_025roc", "source_sha256": "9d41d234f5a78261ff5128534621f14abf60178f3552f7329d3931a1c362e53d", "ja": "えへへ……。ロコは、ユリコと仲良くなれて\n嬉しいですよ。みんなとも、仲良くしたいです。", "zh": "嘿嘿……ROCO很开心能和百合子成为朋友。\n也想和大家变得要好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1089_p", "source_sha256": "d64a71ec0cd742e8f356966546b915cdf51d5cdb2de74a58f51a2450988b48d7", "ja": "なら、せっかくの機会だ。ライブが終わったら、\n改めてみんなと話す機会を作ろうか。", "zh": "那么，难得的好机会，等演唱会结束后，\n我再制造一些大家能互动的契机吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1090_026yur", "source_sha256": "d1bbc198631efcfc6665ae5a2a72321d093431292d32ff958459b3da25fe965f", "ja": "えっ？\n{$P$}さん……いいんですか？", "zh": "咦？\n{$P$}先生……真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_010_1091_p", "source_sha256": "c6d68c41de2d38a18721e3d1e9db32afb1d72a589190fad46dd297720de8fec7", "ja": "もちろん、いいに決まってるよ。\nだから、ライブ頑張ろうな！", "zh": "当然可以啊。\n所以你们演唱会要好好加油喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
